#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &kmplot;"
msgstr "Configuración de &kmplot;"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:3
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the &kmplot; configuration dialog, select <menuchoice><guimenu>"
"Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kmplot;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
". A number of settings (<guimenuitem>Colors...</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>"
"Coordinate System...</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Scaling...</guimenuitem> "
"and <guimenuitem>Fonts...</guimenuitem>) can only be changed from the <guimenu>"
"Edit</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Para aceder ao diálogo de configuración de &kmplot;, escolla <menuchoice>"
"<guimenu>Configuración</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configurar "
"&kmplot;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Hai algúns parámetros (<guimenuitem>"
"Constantes...</guimenuitem> e <guimenuitem>Sistema de Coordenadas</guimenuitem>"
") que só poden ser mudados desde o menú <guimenu>Edición</guimenu>."

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>General</guilabel> Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración <guilabel>Xeral</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:12
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set global settings which automatic will be saved when you exit "
"&kmplot;. In the first page you can set calculation-precision, angle-mode "
"(radians and degrees), background color and zoom in and zoom out factors."
msgstr ""
"Aquí pode definir os parámetro globais que serán guardados automaticamente "
"cando saia de &kmplot;. Na primeira páxina pode escoller a unidades dos graus "
"(radiáns ou graus sexaxesimais), os factores de ampliación e redución, e se "
"mostrar o trazado avanzado da gráfica."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: configuration.docbook:15
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>screenshot of the &kmplot; settings dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>Captura de pantalla do diálogo de Configuración Xeral</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: configuration.docbook:21
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>screenshot of the &kmplot; settings dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Captura de pantalla do diálogo de Configuración Xeral</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second page let you define you own constants. &kmplot; saves the constants "
"in the same file as &kcalc; does. That means you can create a constant in "
"&kmplot;, close the program and load it in &kcalc; and vice versa. &kmplot; "
"only supports constant names that consist of one capital character and if you "
"in &kcalc; define a constant name that is not one character, the name will be "
"truncated. E.g, if you already have the constants \"apple\" and \"bananas\" in "
"&kcalc;, they will be renamed to \"A\" and \"B\" in &kmplot;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Colors</guilabel> Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración de <guilabel>Cores</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Coords</guilabel> tab of the <guilabel>Colors</guilabel> "
"configuration dialog, you can change the colors of the axes and grid of the "
"main &kmplot; area."
msgstr ""
"Na páxina de <guilabel>Coordenadas</guilabel> do diálogo de configuración de "
"<guilabel>Cores</guilabel>, poderá escoller as cores dos eixos e da grella  da "
"área de debuxo de &kmplot;."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: configuration.docbook:38
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>screenshot of the colors configuration dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Captura de pantalla do diálogo de Cores</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: configuration.docbook:44
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>screenshot of the colors configuration dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Captura de pantalla do diálogo de Cores</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:49
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Default Function Colors</guilabel> tab, you can change the "
"colors used for the graphs of the ten functions allowed in &kmplot;."
msgstr ""
"A opción <guilabel>Cores por Omisión da Función</guilabel> "
"controla as cores que serán escollidas ao crear novas funcións."

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Coordinate System</guimenuitem> Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración do <guimenuitem>Sistema de Coordenadas</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Axes</guilabel> Configuration"
msgstr "A configuración dos <guilabel>Eixos</guilabel>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "X-Axis"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:64
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sets the range for the x-axis scale. You can choose one of the predefined "
"ranges, or select <guilabel>Custom</guilabel> to make your own. Note that in "
"the <guilabel>Custom</guilabel> boxes, you can use the predefined functions and "
"constants (see <xref linkend=\"func-predefined\"/>) as the extremes of the "
"range (&eg;, set <guilabel>Min:</guilabel> to <userinput>2*pi</userinput>"
"). You can even use functions you have defined to set the extremes of the axis "
"range. For example, if you have defined a function <userinput>"
"f(x)=x^2</userinput>, you could set <guilabel>Min:</guilabel> to <userinput>"
"f(3)</userinput>, which would make the lower end of the range equal to 9."
msgstr ""
"Axusta o rango da escala do eixo X. Lembre que pode usar as funcións e "
"constantes predefinidas (consulte <xref linkend=\"func-predefined\"/>"
") como extremos do rango (&eg; axuste <guilabel>Mín:</guilabel> como <userinput>"
"2*pi</userinput>). Tamén pode usar función definidas por si, para estabelecer "
"os extremos do rango dos eixos. Por exemplo, se ten definida unha función "
"<userinput>f(x) = x^2</userinput>, pode indicar que <guilabel>Mín:</guilabel> "
"sexa <userinput>f(3)</userinput>, que porá o mínimo do rango para 9."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Y-Axis"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:80
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the range for the y-axis. See <quote>X-Axis</quote> above."
msgstr ""
"Configura o rango do eixo y. Consulte enriba <quote>Rango do eixo X</quote>."

