#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:139
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Grid</guilabel> Configuration"
msgstr "A configuración dos <guilabel>Eixos</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can set the <guilabel>Grid Style</guilabel> to one of four options:"
msgstr ""
"Pode indicar unha entre catro opcións para o <guilabel>"
"Estilo da Grella</guilabel>:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nengunha"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "No gridlines are drawn on the plot area"
msgstr "Non de mostra nengunha grella na área de debuxo"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lines"
msgstr "Liñas"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight lines form a grid of squares on the plot area."
msgstr ""
"A grella ha estar formada  por liñas que forman cadrados na área de debuxo."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crosses"
msgstr "Cruces"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Crosses are drawn to indicate points where x and y have integer values (&eg;, "
"(1,1), (4,2) &etc;)."
msgstr ""
"Móstranse cruces para indicar os pontos onde x e y toman valores inteiros "
"(&eg;, (1,1), (4,2) &etc;)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Polar"
msgstr "Polar"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lines of constant radius and of constant angle are drawn on the plot area."
msgstr "Móstranse liñas de raio constante e de ángulo constante."

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Line width</guilabel> option is used to set the width of the "
"lines of the grid."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:181
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Scaling</guilabel> Configuration"
msgstr "Configuración do <guilabel>Diagrama</guilabel>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: configuration.docbook:184
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>screenshot of the scaling configuration dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>Captura de pantalla do diálogo de Tipos de Letra</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: configuration.docbook:190
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>screenshot of the scaling configuration dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Captura de pantalla do diálogo de Tipos de Letra</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each axis, you can set the <guilabel>Scaling:</guilabel> and <guilabel>"
"Printing:</guilabel> of one tic. The <guilabel>Scaling:</guilabel> "
"option selects how many units apart the axis tics will be (and therefore, how "
"far apart grid lines will be drawn), and the <guilabel>Printing:</guilabel> "
"option selects the length of one tic when displayed on the screen or printed. "
"In this way, these options can be used to change the size of the graph on "
"screen or on a page: For example, doubling the <guilabel>Printing:</guilabel> "
"setting whilst keeping the <guilabel>Scaling:</guilabel> "
"setting the same will result in the graph doubling in in height or width."
msgstr ""

